<title>CANADA: Morgan Hydrocarbons says is on the block.</title>
<headline>Morgan Hydrocarbons says is on the block.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Hydrocarbons Inc, rumored as a takeover target, said on Wednesday it formed a special committee after receiving &quot;unsolicited expressions of interest&quot; in the company.</p>
<p>It said the board-appointed committee was &quot;considering various strategic alternatives available to the company to maximize shareholder value in response&quot; to the expressions of interest.</p>
<p>The company also said it hired ARC Financial Corp as its financial adviser.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
